         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The MC33269/NCV33269 series are low dropout, medium current, fixed and adjustable, positive voltage regulators specifically designed for use in low input voltage applications. These devices offer the circuit designer an economical solution for precision voltage regulation, while keeping power losses to a minimum.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
